    {
      "id": "u_7b95e961a4f1e61960a1632e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Custom widgets are a special subset of scripts that render graphical elements in certain parts of the application. These can be used to add new functionality to the Trilium application.",
      "sourceHash": "7b95e961a4f1e61960a1632e25bdcec06ce8711cd4ef38f6c88f990b17f84500",
      "context": "Custom Widgets",
      "contextHash": "08f7c7b55fe0febbbe603746f7c73402c6fd6f10f4d8ebbc4804808609adf4c2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ee2ee784fd11158c8b5d6f7d_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Preact with JSX vs. vanilla jQuery__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "ee2ee784fd11158c8b5d6f7d99d1eee8a5e59c2af628f1f740d4535fb606224f",
      "context": "Custom Widgets > Preact with JSX vs. vanilla jQuery",
      "contextHash": "076d8eecc533c3dbe7f9414756658542494e3728c13bafbd737191aa81fafb33",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f537cf74f609e7fe37e2ecff_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In older versions of Trilium, custom widgets were exclusively written in a combination of jQuery with Trilium's internal widget architecture (e.g., __TRILIUM_PH_0__, __TRILIUM_PH_1__).",
      "sourceHash": "f537cf74f609e7fe37e2ecffb2e7abc0960fb2ffddd9e4adf162433fc09fb371",
      "context": "Custom Widgets > Preact with JSX vs. vanilla jQuery",
      "contextHash": "076d8eecc533c3dbe7f9414756658542494e3728c13bafbd737191aa81fafb33",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_71415502a7fdb18d6a1c3b26_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Starting with v0.101.0, custom widgets can also be written in JSX using the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Preact__TRILIUM_PH_1__ framework. Both legacy and Preact widgets have the same capabilities, with a single difference:",
      "sourceHash": "71415502a7fdb18d6a1c3b268698ec19ab551c675abaeeeb9aafeb1527d6ca5d",
      "context": "Custom Widgets > Preact with JSX vs. vanilla jQuery",
      "contextHash": "076d8eecc533c3dbe7f9414756658542494e3728c13bafbd737191aa81fafb33",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9d20581e8bccf0a2333304a8_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Preact widgets are content-sized by default whereas legacy widgets need __TRILIUM_PH_0__ applied in the constructor. For more information, see the corresponding section in __TRILIUM_PH_1__Troubleshooting__TRILIUM_PH_2__.",
      "sourceHash": "9d20581e8bccf0a2333304a872d2ddc29e40069e51d8425981f2046bf4dca5f2",
      "context": "Custom Widgets > Preact with JSX vs. vanilla jQuery",
      "contextHash": "076d8eecc533c3dbe7f9414756658542494e3728c13bafbd737191aa81fafb33",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_db613a7af980943f9d0409b1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Wherever possible, widget examples will be both in the legacy and Preact format.",
      "sourceHash": "db613a7af980943f9d0409b1f9240af53935da178f766baf2486b7efc67019c9",
      "context": "Custom Widgets > Preact with JSX vs. vanilla jQuery",
      "contextHash": "076d8eecc533c3dbe7f9414756658542494e3728c13bafbd737191aa81fafb33",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_07b367a1edd91ca588e6f5ca_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Creating a custom widget__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "07b367a1edd91ca588e6f5ca49532ea891f14b4e375a7c9265a9f1ff70db87af",
