    {
      "id": "u_c4fefc0ac58202f8682cbfb2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The quickest way is __TRILIUM_PH_0__Insert child note__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Code__TRILIUM_PH_3__ → __TRILIUM_PH_4__Widget__TRILIUM_PH_5__ in the __TRILIUM_PH_6__Note tree contextual menu__TRILIUM_PH_7__. It creates a JSX note with the __TRILIUM_PH_8__ label and a minimal Preact widget to start from.",
      "sourceHash": "c4fefc0ac58202f8682cbfb2d840b609afa99b802869283ff0890431d211c2d3",
      "context": "Custom Widgets > Creating a custom widget",
      "contextHash": "ad0bf89f7fa011f9c8af9e920773ff9af81951ea8eb39b034c9f5249fb52e9e0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
