    {
      "id": "u_9e1924670e7ff53957bdff2b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Although not mandatory, it's best to use a __TRILIUM_PH_0__ instead of a __TRILIUM_PH_1__ or a __TRILIUM_PH_2__.",
      "sourceHash": "9e1924670e7ff53957bdff2b6287edbce1565e092836f4db6011dba36d0803a0",
      "context": "Custom Widgets > Widget location (parent widget)",
      "contextHash": "6d6116f99dc63eb3f6bc3bd8c58f170ec7f35bded248d2951bd30b98d17c1c0d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f1a170e1d6c42e91789a21ab_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To position the widget somewhere else, just change the value passed to __TRILIUM_PH_0__ for legacy widgets or the __TRILIUM_PH_1__ field for Preact. Do note that some positions such as __TRILIUM_PH_2__ and __TRILIUM_PH_3__ have special requirements that need to be accounted for (see the table above).",
      "sourceHash": "f1a170e1d6c42e91789a21ab1a34c98345578ebacb908f37c8a93fa8584ab2a1",
      "context": "Custom Widgets > Widget location (parent widget)",
      "contextHash": "6d6116f99dc63eb3f6bc3bd8c58f170ec7f35bded248d2951bd30b98d17c1c0d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4cc09b64543fca7ecb58b14d_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Multiple widgets in a single note__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "4cc09b64543fca7ecb58b14d0b5a6fb4164dd7ad73978883f2fd03cc65f45431",
      "context": "Custom Widgets > Multiple widgets in a single note",
      "contextHash": "310282372917540b9114dd4a434b4dc69bd439e3f2ba8932932b2696570a4733",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d65fb6d70d5a5d910ee211f3_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A widget note usually returns one widget, but it can also return an array of them. This is useful when several widgets share code or state, since they can all live in the same note instead of being split across notes that need a shared module.",
      "sourceHash": "d65fb6d70d5a5d910ee211f313ba2e68f174a2cdf6e40e930b4499c1f13c1b23",
      "context": "Custom Widgets > Multiple widgets in a single note",
      "contextHash": "310282372917540b9114dd4a434b4dc69bd439e3f2ba8932932b2696570a4733",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_79929d582a27a2c72407274b_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Each widget of the array is registered on its own, so they can have different parents and positions. A widget that is missing its __TRILIUM_PH_0__ (or __TRILIUM_PH_1__ for Preact) is reported as an error without affecting the other widgets of the note.",
      "sourceHash": "79929d582a27a2c72407274bea2bccb350addfdfa93ee5dec42880630fba7656",
      "context": "Custom Widgets > Multiple widgets in a single note",
      "contextHash": "310282372917540b9114dd4a434b4dc69bd439e3f2ba8932932b2696570a4733",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
